	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"Figure-rise Standard ピッコロがパッケージをリニューアルして登場！！",
			"• パワーアップしたマッスルビルドシステムにより、ピッコロの特徴的な腕の筋肉を成形色のみで再現！",
			"• さらに、可動もパワーアップ！肩と腕の引き出し関節により腕組みポーズも可能に！",
			"• ピッコロの代名詞マントとターバンが付属し、様々なシーンのピッコロが楽しめる！",
			"• 他のキャラクターと組み合わせて遊びの幅がさらに広がる新パーツ「ドラマティックパーツ」には「超サイヤ人 孫悟飯」の頭髪パーツが付属！師弟コンビの劇中シーンが再現可能に！",
			"• エフェクトパーツはピッコロの必殺技「魔貫光殺砲」が付属！"
		],
		"en": [
			"Figure-rise Standard Piccolo is now available with a renewed package! !",
			"• With the powered-up muscle build system, Piccolo's characteristic arm muscles are reproduced using only molded colors!",
			"• Furthermore, the movement is powered up! The arms can be posed with folded arms thanks to the pull-out joints in the shoulders and arms!",
			"• Comes with Piccolo's signature cloak and turban, so you can enjoy Piccolo in various scenes!",
			"• New parts \"Dramatic Parts\" that can be combined with other characters to further expand the range of play include \"Super Saiyan Son Gohan\" hair parts! Scenes from the play between teacher and student can now be recreated!",
			"• Effect parts include Piccolo's special move \"Makan Kosatsuhou\"!"
		]
	},
